[
  {
    "index": 0,
    "text": "Lesson 89 For sale Listen to the tape then answer this question.",
    "start": 0.63,
    "end": 10.273,
    "zh": "第89课 出售 听录音,然后回答这个问题。",
    "zh_hant": "第89課 出售 聽錄音,然後回答這個問題。"
  },
  {
    "index": 1,
    "text": "Why couldn't Nigel decide?",
    "start": 11.216,
    "end": 14.437,
    "zh": "为什么奈杰尔无法决定？",
    "zh_hant": "為什麼奈傑爾無法決定？"
  },
  {
    "index": 2,
    "text": "Good afternoon.",
    "start": 16.238,
    "end": 17.759,
    "zh": "下午好。",
    "zh_hant": "下午好。"
  },
  {
    "index": 3,
    "text": "I believe that this house is for sale.",
    "start": 18.519,
    "end": 22.521,
    "zh": "我相信这房子是待售的。",
    "zh_hant": "我相信這房子是待售的。"
  },
  {
    "index": 4,
    "text": "That's right.",
    "start": 22.701,
    "end": 23.942,
    "zh": "没错。",
    "zh_hant": "沒錯。"
  },
  {
    "index": 5,
    "text": "May I have a look at it, please?",
    "start": 24.482,
    "end": 27.784,
    "zh": "我可以看看它吗？",
    "zh_hant": "我可以看看它嗎？"
  },
  {
    "index": 6,
    "text": "Yes, of course.",
    "start": 27.984,
    "end": 29.725,
    "zh": "是的，当然可以。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，當然可以。"
  },
  {
    "index": 7,
    "text": "Come in.",
    "start": 29.665,
    "end": 30.645,
    "zh": "请进。",
    "zh_hant": "請進。"
  },
  {
    "index": 8,
    "text": "How long have you lived here?",
    "start": 31.646,
    "end": 34.407,
    "zh": "你在这里住了多久了？",
    "zh_hant": "你在這裡住了多久了？"
  },
  {
    "index": 9,
    "text": "I've lived here for twenty years.",
    "start": 34.988,
    "end": 37.929,
    "zh": "我在这里住了二十年了。",
    "zh_hant": "我在這裡住了二十年了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 10,
    "text": "Twenty years!",
    "start": 38.209,
    "end": 40.13,
    "zh": "二十年！",
    "zh_hant": "二十年！"
  },
  {
    "index": 11,
    "text": "That's a long time.",
    "start": 40.371,
    "end": 42.551,
    "zh": "那真是一段很长的时间。",
    "zh_hant": "那真是一段很長的時間。"
  },
  {
    "index": 12,
    "text": "Yes, I've been here since 1976.",
    "start": 42.712,
    "end": 48.084,
    "zh": "是的，我从1976年起就一直在这里。",
    "zh_hant": "是的，我從1976年起就一直在這裡。"
  },
  {
    "index": 13,
    "text": "Then why do you want to sell it?",
    "start": 48.134,
    "end": 51.456,
    "zh": "那你为什么要卖掉它？",
    "zh_hant": "那你為什麼要賣掉它？"
  },
  {
    "index": 14,
    "text": "Because I've just retired.",
    "start": 51.736,
    "end": 54.417,
    "zh": "因为我刚退休了。",
    "zh_hant": "因為我剛退休了。"
  },
  {
    "index": 15,
    "text": "I want to buy a small house in the country.",
    "start": 54.798,
    "end": 58.819,
    "zh": "我想在乡下买一栋小房子。",
    "zh_hant": "我想在鄉下買一棟小房子。"
  },
  {
    "index": 16,
    "text": "How much does this house cost?",
    "start": 60.2,
    "end": 63.08,
    "zh": "这房子要多少钱？",
    "zh_hant": "這房子要多少錢？"
  },
  {
    "index": 17,
    "text": "￡68, 500.",
    "start": 62.68,
    "end": 67.53,
    "zh": "六万八千五百英镑。",
    "zh_hant": "六萬八千五百英鎊。"
  },
  {
    "index": 18,
    "text": "That's a lot of money!",
    "start": 68.344,
    "end": 70.585,
    "zh": "那可真是一大笔钱！",
    "zh_hant": "那可真是一大筆錢！"
  },
  {
    "index": 19,
    "text": "It's worth every penny of it.",
    "start": 70.886,
    "end": 73.647,
    "zh": "它值这份价钱。",
    "zh_hant": "它值這份價錢。"
  },
  {
    "index": 20,
    "text": "Well, I like the house,",
    "start": 73.887,
    "end": 76.808,
    "zh": "嗯，我喜欢这房子，",
    "zh_hant": "嗯，我喜歡這房子，"
  },
  {
    "index": 21,
    "text": "but I can't decide yet.",
    "start": 76.849,
    "end": 79.75,
    "zh": "但我还不能决定。",
    "zh_hant": "但我還不能決定。"
  },
  {
    "index": 22,
    "text": "My wife must see it first.",
    "start": 80.374,
    "end": 83.401,
    "zh": "我妻子必须先看看。",
    "zh_hant": "我妻子必須先看看。"
  },
  {
    "index": 23,
    "text": "Women always have the last word.",
    "start": 83.783,
    "end": 87.069,
    "zh": "女人总是有最后发言权。",
    "zh_hant": "女人總是有最後發言權。"
  }
]
